      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know there are people to talk to, but they're just going to tell me to hang on and fight for a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore. is there really any point in fighting to stay for a version of me that’s just a ghost? it feels so much more logical to just... step out now, while i still have some control over it. wouldn't it be more graceful to go on my own terms?",
